<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0032_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Castle. I’m\nDarach. The butler. Since 1987.\rI host on behalf of Lady Caitlin, the\nowner. She is...restin’. Always.\rFirst, I must confiscate any items your\nhomies are holdin’. Castle rules.\rThey will be returned when you leave.\nProb’ly.\rI also have 10 Castle Points, CP, for\nyou. They only good here. Like arcade\ftickets.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome back.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, as per the rules, I must\nconfiscate your homies’ held items.\fAgain.\rThey will be returned when you leave.\rAnd here are 10 Castle Points. Spend\nthem wisely. Or don’t. I’m just the\fbutler.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kindly hold. I’m polishin’ somethin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hella well. Please proceed. Wipe your\nfeet.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your fainted homies shall be revived. We\nhave staff for that. Underpaid staff.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Coming up is battle no. {STRVAR_1 53, 0, 0}.\nI trust you ready? You look sweaty.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you care to save the last battle\nas your Battle Video?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s battle has been saved\nas a Battle Video.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There was an error.\nThe Battle Video couldn’t be saved.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you care to delete your existin’\nBattle Video and save the last battle?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Saving...\nPlease don’t turn the power off.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Would you like to save and take a break\nfrom playin’?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Do you wish to retire from this\nBattle Castle challenge?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is choosin’.\nPlease wait.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} chose to retire.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Please choose what you wish to do.\nQuickly. Lady Caitlin hate waitin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You may heal a Pokémon or rent an item\nfor it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You may check on your opponent’s\nPokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Battle against a Hustler.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You may take a pass and avoid battlin’\na Hustler.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It will cost {STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0} CP.\nIs that acceptable?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m TERRIBLY sorry.\nYou lack sufficient CP. You broke.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">From here on, you may choose “Pass”\nand avoid battlin’ a Hustler.\rIf you don’t wish to battle a certain\nTrainer, choose “Pass.”\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Caitlin: ...\nDarach! CP for this Hustler. AT ONCE.\f*goes back to sleep*</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, bravo. A FANTASTIC\nvictory. I clapped. Quietly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, well done. Quite\nremarkable. Lady Caitlin almost woke\fup.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, good show.\nA hard-fought win, yes? You sweatin’ on\fmy carpet.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, good effort...\nI suppose. Barely.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, bravo. A FANTASTIC\nvictory. I clapped. Quietly.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, well done. Quite\nremarkable. Lady Caitlin almost woke\fup.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, good show.\nA hard-fought win, yes? You sweatin’ on\fmy carpet.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, good effort...\nI suppose. Barely.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lady Caitlin has instructed me to award\nyou {STRVAR_1 51, 0, 0} CP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: Congratulations on clearin’\nseven consecutive battles.\rFor your valiant effort, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0},\nplease accept this BP. Lady Caitlin\finsists.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0} BP!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We’ll return any items that we were\nholdin’ for you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Saving...\nDon’t turn off the power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Caitlin: ...PASS?\n...How UNCOUTH! Darach, my fan!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CONTINUE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RECORD</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">REST</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RETIRE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SELF</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OPPONENT</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">PASS</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, congratulations!\rYou to be commended for keepin’ the\nstreak alive.\rLady Caitlin, appreciatin’ your worth,\ndemands you face the Castle Valet.\rMe. It’s me. I’m the valet.\nYou prepared, yes?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: Welcome.\rI’m Darach, the Castle Valet. Butler by\nday. Butler by night.\rLady Caitlin does NOT accept defeat.\rHowever, for reasons I’m not at\nliberty to disclose, she can’t battle.\fShe’s asleep. She’s ALWAYS asleep.\rSo I battle in her ladyship’s place.\r...You won’t be shortchanged by facin’\nme. I polish silverware VIOLENTLY.\rEn garde!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: Your mastery of Pokémon is as\nbreathtakin’ as ever.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you certainly are to be\ncommended.\r...However, if I may say so, I noticed\nsomethin’ about the way you battle.\rAfter all, I have had the opportunity\nto watch you closely firsthand.\rSo, what is it that I noticed?\rAs a Hustler myself, it is but proper\netiquette to show you in a battle.\rLet us begin!\nEn garde!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you truly a\nSUPERLATIVE talent!\rI drew on every reserve of experience\nand etiquette from generations of\fglorious servitude.\rAnd STILL I failed. My ancestors weep.\rI shall go tell Lady Caitlin. She’s gon’\nthrow a slipper at me.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, please do return. We’ll be\ndelighted. I’ll make tea.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0032_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Darach: I’m HUMBLED...\rWhat I thought was a weakness was only\nillusory... Or you fixed it MID-BATTLE.\rEither way, stunnin’ again.\rThough she won’t say it, Lady Caitlin is\nquite taken with your style. She\fmumbled\fyour name in her sleep.\rFor her sake, please return!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
